          "h1": "The Secret Weapon Your Signal Chain Is Missing",
          "description": "The Voodoo Lab Giggity goes beyond overdrive. It&#039;s an analog preamp that transforms any rig and gives you tones you can&#039;t get anywhere else.",
          "snippet": "Voodoo Lab Giggity Review: Beyond Overdrive",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Voodoo Lab Giggity Review: Beyond Overdrive Home - Voodoo Lab HOME PRODUCTS POWER Pedal Power ® 2 PLUS Pedal Power ® 3 Pedal Power ® 3 PLUS Pedal Power ® 4×4 Pedal Power ® ISO-5 Pedal Power ® MONDO Pedal Power ® X4 Expander Kit Pedal Power ® X8 Pedal Power ® X4 Pedal Power ® X4-18V Expander Kit Pedal Power ® X4-18V PEDALBOARDS Dingbat ® PX Pedalboard with PX-8 PLUS Pedal Switcher Dingbat ® Large Dingbat ® Medium Dingbat ® Small-EX Dingbat ® Small Dingbat ® TINY SWITCHING Amp Selector ABY Isolated Output Switch/Blend Amp Selector PRO Isolated Output Switch/Blend Control Switcher MIDI Amp Commander GCX True Bypass 8-Loop Rackmount Audio Switcher Ground Control Pro MIDI Foot Controller HEX True Bypass 6-Loop Audio Switcher PX-8 PLUS True Bypass Programmable Pedal Switcher EFFECTS GIGGITY ® Analog Overdrive + Preamp Sparkle Drive ® MOD Superfuzz ® ACCESSORIES Cables Mounting Brackets Power Switcher Accessories Pedalboard Accessories Merch Apparel PURCHASE UNITED STATES CANADA INTERNATIONAL ONLINE QUICK ORDER ARTISTS BLOG SUPPORT REGISTER YOUR PRODUCT USER GROUP MANUALS CONTACT US ABOUT Quick Order Manuals Contact Account Privacy Policy Return Policy Terms &#038; Conditions ✕ Add a Second Channel to your Amp June 24, 2026 The Ultimate Guide to Guitar Effects Switching Systems MIDI Control June 24, 2026 Add a Second Channel to your Amp June 24, 2026 The Ultimate Guide to Guitar Effects Switching Systems MIDI Control June 24, 2026 Published by Darrin Fox at June 24, 2026 Categories Product Demos Tags preamp Giggity SIgnal Chain Tone Tips overdrive The Secret Weapon Your Signal Chain Is Missing Learn how the Voodoo Lab Giggity delivers the tone you&#8217;ve been chasing. In a sea of copycat overdrive pedals, the Voodoo Lab Giggity ® Analog Overdrive + Preamp stands alone. In this video, James Santiago shows you how Giggity goes beyond your average dirt pedal, delivering “analog mastering” detail and vibe to any rig. No matter your guitar, amp, or effects, Giggity gives you tones unobtainable with any other pedal. Breaking Down the Controls 1. Loudness for Preamp Voicing This is the input gain for Giggity&#8217;s preamp section. You can use a low setting for cleaner tones or turn it all the way up for some grit and compression making a stiff amp come alive under your fingers. 2. Surgical Tone Shaping with Body Air Beyond traditional bass and treble controls, use Giggity’s Body and Air to fine tune your tones. Body: From taming an &#8220;ice-pick&#8221; bridge pickup to clearing up a muddy humbucker or adding weight to a Strat’s rear pickup, Body boosts or cuts lower midrange/upper bass frequencies. Air: Add shimmer and clarity that’s impossible to get with a standard presence or treble control without introducing harshness. 3. Add Final Touch with Sun/Moon Switch Giving you magic in four positions, Sun/Moon changes the entire gain structure of the preamp. Sun: Bright and alive — open the curtain, move towards the sun. Moon: Cooler and thick— add weight and depth, lean to the dark. 4. Master for Output Volume Adjusts Giggity’s overall level to your amp. Crank to push your amp into rough n’ ready overdrive or back down to unity gain for more transparency. Giggity ® Analog Overdrive + Preamp FAQ Where should I put the Giggity in my signal chain? You can use Giggity two ways: Up Front: Place it first to &#8220;pre-master&#8221; your guitar’s pickups, shaping how your overdrives and everything downstream react to your playing. At the End: Place it last to shape your overall tone before hitting your amp. This is also the best way to dial in an unfamiliar backline amp. Does Giggity replace my Overdrive? Not necessarily. While the Loudness knob will add some grit, Giggity is designed to make your existing overdrives — and everything else — sound better . Is Giggity true bypass? Yes. Like all Voodoo Lab pedals, Giggity features true-bypass switching via high-reliability gold-contact relays. —Darrin Fox Share Darrin Fox Related posts June 24, 20",
