          "description": "Learn more about VOX Valvenergy Copperhead Drive overdrive, distortion, preamp, cab sim pedal on PedalPedia - the most comprehensive online resource for effect pedals ▶️ Official specs, manuals, product videos and more",
          "snippet": "Valvenergy Copperhead Drive by VOX | RockBoard | PedalPedia",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Valvenergy Copperhead Drive by VOX | RockBoard | PedalPedia Skip to main content LOG IN EXPLORE VOX Valvenergy Copperhead Drive LOG IN TO SUGGEST IMPROVEMENTS OVERDRIVE DISTORTION PREAMP CAB SIM Description Iconic amp sounds for your pedalboard. The Copperhead Drive valve distortion pedal offers the powerful crunch of British full stack amps in a compact pedal format, powered by Nutube for warm and responsive amp-like tones. Inspired by thick and punchy British amp tones, the Copperhead Drive goes beyond the amp-in-a-box category to offer a truly flexible valve distortion pedal. The all-analog signal path and Nutube allow for genuine overdrive and distortion tones with the feel of a real tube amp, while internally boosted voltage gives greater headroom and dynamics. Media Videos Demo by TonePedia (EN) Demo by Pedal Platform (EN) Manuals Manual (EN, DE, FR, ES, JA) Links Product Page Technical data Width 000.00 mm Depth 000.00 mm Height 000.00 mm Weight 000.00 mm Circuit type analog Voltage 9V DC, center negative Current 95mA More pedals from VOX PREAMP EQUALIZER PREAMP EQUALIZER VOX Valvenergy Tone Sculptor OVERDRIVE BOOSTER OVERDRIVE BOOSTER VOX Valvenergy Fuel Injector WAH WAH VOX Real McCoy Wah VXVRM1 WAH WAH VOX Real McCoy Wah Limited VXVRM1LTD All VOX Pedals Products Pedalboards All-In-One Patchbays QuickMount PedalSafe Power Supplies and Power Cables and Connections Accessories Gear Build your own board Board Configurator PedalPedia Pedalboard Gallery QuickMount Finder Services Find a dealer Find a distributor Frequently Asked Questions Contact Current catalog News Community RockBoard Artists Achievements Your Activity Overview ©2026 Warwick GmbH Co. Music Equipment KG GTC | Imprint | Privacy policy | Accessibility | Cookie Settings",
