          "bodyExcerpt": "Trike Fuzz — Vox Fuzz Pedal | PedalFilter | PedalFilter Skip to main content The guitar pedal database Search pedals The fastest, most visual guitar pedal database. All signal, no noise. About • Collections • Blog • Compare • Privacy Policy • Terms of Service • Submit a pedal • © 2026 PedalFilter Clear Compare ( 0 ) Back Home Vox Trike Fuzz Back to results Vox Trike Fuzz Fuzz Octave Triple-octave fuzz generating +1, -1, and -2 octaves simultaneously. All-discrete circuit, no ICs. The Trike Fuzz delivers three octave settings: +1 octave, -1 and -2 octaves, or all octaves simultaneously. The series/parallel architecture of downward and upward octaves creates sounds impossible with standard octave fuzz units. Dual Volume controls (main and -2 octave), Tone (for +1 octave), and Gain provide extensive shaping. All-discrete circuitry with specially selected diodes—no op-amp ICs—for vintage character throughout. The downward octave circuits run in series, combining in parallel with the upward octave for diverse sound possibilities. Input impedance 680kΩ, 14mA current draw, 280-hour battery life. True bypass, rugged aluminum die-cast body. Demo Videos Specifications Power 9V DC Current Draw 14mA Polarity center-negative Shop This Pedal Reverb Amazon Sweetwater Coming soon Using these links supports PedalFilter at no extra cost to you. ❤️ The fastest, most visual guitar pedal database. All signal, no noise. About • Collections • Blog • Compare • Privacy Policy • Terms of Service • Submit a pedal • © 2026 PedalFilter The guitar pedal database Search pedals You May Also Like Aion FX Rift Beetronics Octahive Caroline Shigeharu Previous Tone Sculptor Next V8 Distortion",
